OL,3,GNEWSAResidents asked for thoughts on
OL,4,Ahow city develops
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being asked to share
OL,7,Ftheir thoughts on how their city
OL,8,Fdevelops in the next 20 years.
OL,10,FSunderland City Council has begun a
OL,11,Fconsultation on its next local plan - a
OL,12,Fdocument outlining which areas are
OL,13,Fsuitable for new housing, offices,
OL,14,Fshops or leisure facilities.
OL,16,FResidents can highlight areas on an
OL,17,Fonline map where they would like to see
OL,18,Fdevelopments and see what other people
OL,19,Fhave selected.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
